	(text "880 nm check: AS7262 reads about 450-650 nm only. Use an AS7263 (NIR) or a separate photodiode for the 880 nm channel. Verify before layout." (at 20 235 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7cdb35bc-dc6d-42aa-908c-2d95af4ce237"))
	(text "Low battery: AP2112K-3.3 dropout (about 0.25 V at 300 mA) means 3.3 V falls out of regulation below roughly 3.6 V cell voltage. Consider a buck regulator." (at 20 241 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ee94005e-7152-48f0-8da1-575ff801edf3"))
	(text "LED banks run from VBAT through 47R. Blue LED forward voltage is about 3.0 V, so brightness drops as the cell discharges. Confirm the current with the bench test." (at 20 247 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3e1dcf77-549b-47d3-98f6-4e3a127ea8cf"))
	(text "Pin-to-net connections are made with net labels at each pin end. Drag wires between labelled pins to tidy the layout in KiCad." (at 20 253 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "28275e5a-16f5-47f3-8bcf-27b32d0cb236"))
	(text "Part numbers and footprints are suggestions. Verify against vendor datasheets before ordering." (at 20 259 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1ead251e-df3c-4bf6-bf33-498efd1fcc9b"))
